#  Outcome metric type vocabulary
#  Target named graph: <https://www.insperity.com/graph/outcome-benchmark/outcome-metric-types>
#  Five metric types read from each outcome statement.
#  Source: PEO Outcome Benchmark (Outcome-Driven Innovation study blueprint)
